    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d4326bbe-9a55-4ff7-a8f2-29ef4ecc51e5-9896182.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 261px;\" /></p><p>Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>37</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
